{"title":"2020 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 2b","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_2\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2020 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2b&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Eleanor has 100 marbles, each of which is black or gold. The ratio of the number of black marbles to the number of gold marbles is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/7/7a7fb95082673f1d3c7a82fdd28d1c54319f8444.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 : 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"33\" height=\"12\" />. How many gold marbles should she add to change this ratio to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/3/fc3d0960a6c286ab01fb58007e5a65a2af1e7c48.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 : 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"32\" height=\"13\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2b&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/8/d5843d7326078a92aa9b96514cffb82851e50f98.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1:4=20:80$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"111\" height=\"14\" />, she has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/a/fea5fcc6d66685ee21f722efcd228eb44d38f262.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$80$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> black and gold marbles, respectively. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/6/5d6f6779bda8f9be9c081924f2039a9699388b0d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1:6=20:120$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"120\" height=\"14\" />, she would need <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/a/aaa4de95cc6371d125d5cf773cdd9f9913dd1d8e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$120$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> gold marbles to create the new ratio, so she must add <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/f/28ff1962094c4217ae9966475de2cae397efd14c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$120-80=\\boxed{40}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"123\" height=\"25\" /> gold marbles.\n</p><p>~originally by eevee9406\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018012630\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.010 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.015 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 38/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 78/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1414/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.319      1 2020_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2\n100.00%    6.319      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:35895:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018012630 and revision id 279171. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}